pecting victims."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Dulakabe Giant","legend":"Rumors speak of a magical Giant who inhabits Dulakabe hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Yirtachi Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Arago (Arachnid) Beliefs."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Gayeki Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Alptar Pantheon."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Claywave Lions","legend":"A gang of swamp brigands."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Velfalin Jaguars","legend":"A gang of swamp bandits."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Babumush Jackals","legend":"A gang of highlander brigands."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Swanhol Jackals","legend":"A gang of highlander bandits."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Ryhemar Apes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Slellunek Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༫༃༬༚༖༽༿༳༌༄༕༄༻༯༒༓༤༯༄༲༄༁༥༉༉༮༉༓༫༳༷༂༠༿༙༡༻༽༫༠༗༢༱༆༅༓༾༯༴༻༈༆་༽་༌༉༨༬༐༴༪༠༁་༻༤༪༨༰༕༡༵༥༒༰༮༸༿༑༪༨༤༊༳༠༅</div>"},{"id":"marker89","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Thordefone Collection","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Earth Joust","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of cunning in Earth, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Rezgvukh Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Rezgvukh, with all manner of local 